# yt-dlp sidecar. 17 MB of third-party binary that goes stale on TikTok's schedule, not
# ours -- fetched per machine and per release build instead of carried in history. See
# sidecars/yt-dlp/README.md for the one-line curl and for why the lookup is optional.
sidecars/yt-dlp/*.exe
sidecars/yt-dlp/yt-dlp
sidecars/yt-dlp/yt-dlp-manifest.json
# Agent tooling's own copy of the skills tree, written per session. `.claude/skills/` is the
# versioned one (see the `!.claude/skills/` rule above); this is a rewritten duplicate of it,
# and committing an agent's scratch copy beside the real one is how two skill files with the
# same name come to disagree.
.agents/
# Length-prefixed MJPEG copies are reconstructible from the retained evidence JPEG.
docs/re/riviu-agent/**/*.framed

